// ISP: the report client sees only the capability it uses.
interface InvoiceReader {
    Invoice find(long id);
}

// SRP: formatting and delivery change for different reasons.
final class InvoiceFormatter {
    String format(Invoice invoice) { return invoice.toString(); }
}

final class InvoiceMailer {
    void send(String body, String address) { /* SMTP adapter */ }
}
```

The focused reader contract addresses ISP. Separating formatting from delivery addresses SRP. Neither improvement automatically proves the other.
